NAME
    ren - Rename a file or directory. A simple new name keeps the item in its current parent directory.

SYNOPSIS
    ren <old_name> <new_name>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Rename a file or directory. A simple new name keeps the item in its current parent directory.

FAT NAME SUPPORT
    The current Inu FAT provider creates and renames entries using FAT 8.3 short names.
    Long-file-name creation and rename are reserved for a later filesystem-provider extension.

EXAMPLES
    ren OLD.TXT NEW.TXT
    ren OLD NEW

FILES
    /System/Commands/REN.CMD
    /INU/HELP/REN.MAN
